      "value": "just as a note, i use the additive layer extensively with eye tracking and have not encountered an issue that has caused it to fail where it only works locally and can at least confirm it continues to work as expected with sdk version 2022.08.29.20.48\ni have had issues with it not applying for other bone transformations as expected (on the hand, for example), but i chalked that up to an issue on my part somewhere else in my setup",
