  "details": "This is easier to show through a video.\nBut essentially if I want this effect or stuff like breathing like I presume the layer is intended for, well, the whole layer is useless.\n\nIt doesn't work in VR either. It just never works. I'm pretty sure the layer is just broken completely.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/MVXQKv6Zb24\n\nEdit: I tested this stuff by copying what I did on the additive layer to the action layer. It works perfectly over emotes set up to work on the action layer, including over the network. Not a full solution because it's only when the action layer is overriding everything else.",
